 "observations": [
  "T01: the cell of the second row and fourth column is printed «ثولنٍ» (a lām joined to the nūn in place of the alif); the cell of the fourth row and second column «توانٍ» (two dots over the first letter); 1200 dpi.",
  "T01: under the nūn of ثوانٍ (eleven cells) a kasratan, measured in the turned type as on p. 10 (2.6-2.9 x 2.4-2.8 pt).",
  "The letter at the foot of the right column is د (with its bar), where p. 10 has ب; the text of p. 11 names the second table اد.",
  "L03: كلَّما: the fatha over the shadda printed broken, in two small pieces (2400 dpi)."
